-----BEGIN PGP PUBLIC KEY BLOCK-----
Comment: PLACEHOLDER - Replace with actual GPG public key

This is a placeholder file. Before releasing, generate a GPG key pair and replace
this file with the actual public key:

1. Generate key (on your signing machine):
   gpg --full-generate-key
   # Choose RSA 4096-bit
   # Name: LightScope Release Signing Key
   # Email: releases@thelightscope.com

2. Export public key:
   gpg --armor --export releases@thelightscope.com > lightscope-release.pub

3. Sign packages:
   gpg --detach-sign --armor -o os-lightscope-X.X.pkg.sig os-lightscope-X.X.pkg

4. Host both the .pkg and .pkg.sig files on thelightscope.com/opnsense/pkg/

-----END PGP PUBLIC KEY BLOCK-----
